hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"203","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi aurat se shaadi kare ya laundi khareede to kahe: Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai aur jis tabiyat par Tune use paida kiya us ki bhalai mangta hun; us ke shar aur jis tabiyat par Tune use paida kiya us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. Oont khareede to kohan pakadkar yahi kahe."
